autoware-localrepo-1-7-1 (1.7.1-2ubuntu2204) jammy; urgency=medium

  * autoware-theme-1-7-1 1.7.1-2: the theme script is now
    apply-autoware-theme-1-7-1, so other Autoware versions can be installed
    beside this one.
  * uninstall-autoware.sh: --purge, --all-versions and -y, as in 1.5.0-3.
  * autoware-full-1-7-1 1.7.1-2 depends on autoware-model-downloader-1-7-1
    instead of autoware-data-1-7-1: run autoware-download-models-1-7-1 as
    your own user to fetch the models into ~/autoware_data. The separate
    autoware-data deb is no longer needed, except offline.

